Global Tailings Review, co-convened by ICMM, UNEP, and the Principles for Responsible Investment. Global Industry Standard on Tailings Management, August 2020. [Official standard and source information](https://globaltailingsreview.org/global-industry-standard/) · [Authorized complete PDF](https://globaltailingsreview.org/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/global-tailings-standard_spreads.pdf).

Read the complete standard, connecting knowledge of affected people and ground/water conditions, lifecycle design/operation, management responsibilities, review, emergency preparedness, and disclosure. A standard-based process and a demonstrated engineering outcome are different claims; application needs the actual facility, jurisdiction, evidence, and implementation.

Official dated metadata/source routes were indexed; a later direct landing request timed out. Preserve actual standard/component rights rather than asserting an unrestricted adaptation licence. Access and identity checked on 29 October 2026. No standard PDF, case data, or compliance claim is bundled.

